# Browser
# Bot1 activates Thornvault Forager's "{T}, Forage: Add two mana in any combination of colors." in the browser, with a Food
# and three cards in the graveyard, so both ways to forage could pay (CR 701.61a, 605.3a, 601.2b): the mana ability asks which
# way to pay its cost, as any activated ability does, before the colors, and it adds its mana with no stack (CR 605.3b).
# Bot1 sacrifices the Food and takes {G}{U}. Turn 1: Black Lotus (sacrificed), the Forager, Gilded Goose with its Food and two
# Lightning Bolts, so the graveyard holds three cards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Thornvault Forager
Forest
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Gilded Goose
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

